WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.280
Late at night, in a quiet room, a small
group of Muslims sits together in a circle.

2
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:10.020
One of them begins to repeat
a single name of Allah.

3
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:15.160
The others join in, over
and over, hour after hour.

4
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.600
Outside, the city sleeps.

5
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.600
Inside, the same word
goes round and round.

6
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.600
Why would anyone give up
a night's sleep for this?

7
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.720
What are they searching for?

8
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:31.060
In this mission, you'll meet the
Sufis, follow the path they describe,

9
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.960
and trace where it began.

10
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.960
Then you'll read one
verse that Sufis treasure,

11
00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.590
and look closely at what it promises.

12
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.120
Your mission: find out what these Muslims
are searching for when they repeat one

13
00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.360
name of Allah.
